window.products.push({"id":842259,"name":"Njsisc Portable Mini Humidifier,Small USB Personal Humidifiers with Quiet Operation,Container Diversity,Length Adjustment,Car Mini Humidifier for Plan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IHiGzUAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Humidifier with Wide Application:the portable mini humidifier can humidify your living space with its 35 ml/h spray capacity,to prevent dry and stuffy air,keep your skin and eyes hydrated even in winter.Thanks to its compact and length adjustable design,it can be used in all the place and occasion you want.We particular recommend to use on office desk,travel trip and car driving.Attention:this product doesn't include the rechargeable battery,need to use with the USB charger. Container Diversity:the mini USB personal humidifier can be perfect fitted for all types of containers,such as glass cup,coffee mug,jar and water bottle.You can adjust the humidifier length according to container height and size.You don't need to worry about to lose the component because of its integrated structure.Note:no water bottle is included. Quiet & Easy Operation:the mini car USB humidifier adopts the newest ultrasonic technology,make it achieve lower power(2 watt) and extreme quiet.It won't noise you sleep at night or any other using situations.Easy control the humidifier with only one press key.First press go to the constant mode and second to intermittent mode. USB Power Supply & Safy:the tabletop humidifier with USB interface,which allow you to plug into any power source like cell phone adapter,power bank,laptop.And the humidifier will shut-off after 6 hours automatically,safy and no worry about the amnesia.Attention:don't plug the product on when the water is use out. Convenient for Trip & Storage:we provide one additional travel bag,you can pack your mini personal humidifier and the accessories very convenient for journey and business trip.You can also put and store the humidifer with this bag when you are planning to use it again in next dry season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IHiGzUAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Njsisc","source_asin":"B09GB1K74V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-842259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GB1K74V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GB1K74V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
