window.products.push({"id":842645,"name":"uxcell Satin Body Pillow Case, Pearl White Silky Body Pillowcases for Hair and Skin, 21x60 Long Pillow Covers with Zipper Closure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAajKAYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♞ ELIMINATES FACIAL FOLDS & LASHES - Silky satin body pillowcases are soft to the touch and allows your face to glide against on pillowcase, the skin is able to move without friction and you wake up without lines on your face from your pillow in the short term, and without fine lines and wrinkles in the long term. In addition, this satin body pillow cover helps keep fragile eyelashes intact, can be especially helpful for those who wear eyelash extensions. ♞ KEEP HAIR SHINY & CLEARS THE COMPLEXION - Our Satin body pillow covers help to avoid frizzing and roughing of the cuticle on any hair texture, reduce hair loss, whether your hair is kinky, curly, wavy or straight. With this long pillowcase, the skin is able to breathe more, unlike cotton will absorb water. These pillow covers are as beneficial to your complexion and hair as they are to your mind for a restful night’s sleep. ♞ BREATHABLE & TEMPERATURE REGULATING - Satin materials helps your skin maintain its moisture, the silky sensation is like a breath of fresh air in the summertime. These body pillow pillowcases are made of 100% satin charmeuse polyester but offer the similar smoothness and cooling qualities of silk at a more affordable price point. NOTE: We have 2 kinds of packaging for random delivery, but it does not affect the quality of the product, please don't mind. ♞ ZIPPER CLOSURE END DESIGN & EASY CARE - Each of our body pillow case has a zipper stitched inside the pocket, the zipper closure makes the silk pillowcase hold your pillow perfectly overnight without move around. Hand wash gently is recommended. Avoid stuffing the pillowcases into a load of laundry containing harsh or heavy fabrics such as denim jeans, as these may snag the satin. Either Tumble Dry on Low Heat or draped over a clothesline, air dry. ♞ 100% SATISFACTION - We you'll love this satin body pillow cover, and if you aren't absolutely satisfied. Please simply contact us to return the product for a full refund. Note: This is the case only, does NOT contain a pillow. Due to the light and screen setting difference, the color of the item may be slightly different from the pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAajKAYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B07THYZYGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-842645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07THYZYGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07THYZYGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
