window.products.push({"id":842753,"name":"Ultra Soft 100% Percale Cotton 4 Piece Bed-Sheet-Set 400 Thread-Count 15 Inch Deep-Pocket - Extremely Lightweight Smooth Stronger Durable Quality Bedd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mbNqlKZ6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"#1 Bed Sheet Set Highest Quality Deep Pocket, Breathable, Durable, Fade Resistant Bedding If You Love A Crisp Sheet, Youll Fall For Our Finely Woven Percale Offerings. Percale Sheets Have A Tight, Flat Cotton Weave With A Crisp Feel That Resembles A Dress Shirt When Ironed. Not That You Must Iron It. Feel Free To Leave It Au Natural For A Rumpled, Livedin Look. Plus, This Option Breathes Well For Those Who Get Warm At Night. You May Think Because Percale Sheets Have A Tighter Weave That They Are Also Warmer. However, Due To The Less Thick Yard Used, Percale Sheets Will Give You A Cooler Sleep Experience. Percale Sheets Are Better For Those Who Sleep Hot Or Live In Warmer Climates And Will Give You A Crisp, Cool Sleep Year Round. Pros: A Crisp, Cool Handfeel. Its The Same Weave As Luxury Hotel Linens Or Your Grandmas Comfy Sheets! Great Durability While Maintaining Softness. Breathability; It Provides A Cool Sleep On Warm Nights And Warm Sleep On Cool Nights. Will Stand Up To Years Of Use. Easy Care For Machine Wash Cold Gentle Cycle, Tumble Dry Low Remove Sheet From Washer Dryer Quickly To Reduce Wrinkling. We Recommend Line Drying To Avoid Wrinkling. Cons: More Prone To Wrinkles. Doesnt Have A Sheen, Or Shiny Appearance. Features And Benefits: Percale Weave Feels Cool And Crisp On The Body Which Will Last Long Even After Many Washes. Hypoallergic Unlikely To Cause An Allergic Reaction To Keep You Safe. Crisp And Airy, For An Ultraluxurious Feel And Exceptional Comfort. Sleep Better And Wake Up Each Morning Feeling Refreshed And Full Of Energy. Perfect Gift For Everyone Men, Women And Children. Great For Any Occasion Valentines, Mothers, Fathers Day And Christmas Our 100% No Questions Asked, Replacement Promise Is The Best In The Business. Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mbNqlKZ6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rajlinen","source_asin":"B0751DZ9VZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-842753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0751DZ9VZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0751DZ9VZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
