window.products.push({"id":842898,"name":"Bayview Essentials- Unbreakable Melamine Daily Plates- Set of 6 (Salad Plate, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UwvZbATvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amuse Home Amuse Home was established in the Pacific North West in 2017. Its origin was a thorough rationalization of the manufacturing process with an eye to creating simple, low-cost, good quality products. Specifically, we reexamined products through three lenses: material selection, inspection process and packaging simplification. Excellent Quality Products In notable contrast to the prevailing over-embellished products in the marketplace, Amuse Home’s products both won great appreciation and sent shock waves across the world. Amuse Home products are succinct, but they are not in the minimalist style. Simplicity and emptiness yield the ultimate universality, embracing the feelings and thoughts of all people. We have been credited with being “resource-saving”, “low-priced”, “simple”, “anonymous” and “nature-oriented”. Great Gift Option - for any festival and anniversary like Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Wedding, Housewarming, Baby showering, Graduating, etc. Send the most beautiful gift to the one you loved. Clean Simple Design & Sustainable Production These attributes can be noticed by our line of products, which are designed with the utmost quality with focus in sustainable sourcing practices. This includes Plastic ware from Belgium, professional porcelain dinnerware from Asia, ceramic ware from Latin America, Soy Candle handcrafted in Canada among others.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UwvZbATvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amuse Home","source_asin":"B07YYM33N7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-842898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYM33N7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYM33N7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
